    "searchText": "urgent convoy refuel critical fleet refuel refueling_pyro_hydrogen_6m_rank4 united wayfarers club careercontract standing refuel pickup: pyro, pyro, stanton heyo,\n\nover at [location] we just got a refueling job for an entire small fleet of ships who all together need [fueltype]. talk about when it rains it pours!\n\nthe client will pay you at the rate of [refuelrequest], and as a united wayfarers club contractor, you will also qualify for the uwc service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nunfortunately, where they're held up isn't the nicest of sectors so i'd be alert for any tomfoolery while you're doing the run. \n\nit'll be best to try get them all back on their way as soon as you can.\n\nhappy trails,\n\ndina deloit\ndispatch hub\nunited wayfarers club\n\"we’ve got your back\" critical refuel request: [ship] refuel request: [ship] 23a6c554-3ed2-48ff-87e3-5c3521ca7ec3 2c50bc3a-40d9-447a-baf2-3a9547125ae2 51df6219-059e-400e-af6c-ee14b36f58e6 934a41e0-4a33-415a-823e-0e7f3d713b8b 9f22600f-aae7-4470-8f79-a614bb866b2b bd1e48f4-7d7a-4ec3-934c-2441842dc884 5eec8aad-4aa8-4f4b-b72d-42049a9e19eb 9262cdc6-6033-4364-a0f4-103713494a05 4a7f1bcc-290c-4801-bcee-483cc4c1771c 9b51e83c-1377-417f-a641-5b2069c1e423 e29a04dc-6e45-49d5-90ef-8fad002da766 e333dac6-8d53-46de-b749-6c6dabaf09b5 f3882e94-1e77-4606-8965-3c2a51dc6841 29c23153-3ebf-4c34-9128-2174da5d60e0 2c5309c8-6fb0-419a-9727-98cd07d3b77b 49a2d0fe-8428-4a1f-af74-df332a4ef828 5347637c-8313-45c8-850e-120346391b40 c88fe59f-39b3-40ad-93a6-db76b505042b f5d62781-5f6b-4eb0-8167-1362ebcaa3d8 f81c98d1-59ac-420d-8ab3-2a839ae41b6f blueprint: fuel nozzle: norfield, marlin, lindstrom, harkin +4 standing +200 19,750 auec standing +100 49,250 auec"
